---
---
<section id="tjenester" class="bg-white py-16 dark:bg-slate-900 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-3 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand-accent" data-animate></div>
    <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-accent" data-animate data-delay="100">For IT-ansvarlige og arkitekter</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-brand-blue dark:text-white sm:text-4xl" data-animate data-delay="150">Hva vi leverer</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300" data-animate data-delay="200">
      Senior kapasitet innen drift, sikkerhet, migrering, arkitektur og prosjektledelse. Vi jobber med egne konsulenter og gjennom vårt nettverk av frittstående Microsoft-spesialister.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

      <article data-animate="from-left" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M15.75 5.25a3 3 0 0 1 3 3m3 0a6 6 0 0 1-7.029 5.912c-.563-.097-1.159.026-1.563.43L10.5 17.25H8.25v2.25H6v2.25H2.25v-2.818c0-.597.237-1.17.659-1.591l6.499-6.499c.404-.404.527-1 .43-1.563A6 6 0 0 1 21.75 8.25Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Identitet og tilgang</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Entra ID, hybrid identity, Conditional Access og Zero Trust som reduserer risiko uten å hindre produktivitet.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-animate data-delay="100" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 0 1-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0 1 15 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 5.25m18 0H3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Klient og endpoint</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Intune, Autopilot, compliance og moderne enhetsforvaltning for trygg og effektiv arbeidsflate.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-animate="from-right" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Sikkerhet og beskyttelse</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Defender-plattformen, sikkerhetsforbedring, baseline-herding, overvåkning og beredskap.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-animate="from-left" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 0 0 2.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 0 0 4.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 0 0-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 0 1 8.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0 1 11.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 1 1-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 0 1 6.75 0Zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 1 1-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 0 1 5.25 0Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Samarbeid og produktivitet</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Microsoft 365, Teams, SharePoint og Exchange Online med fokus på styring, adopsjon og kontroll.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-animate data-delay="100" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M2.25 15a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5H18a3.75 3.75 0 0 0 1.332-7.257 3 3 0 0 0-3.758-3.848 5.25 5.25 0 0 0-10.233 2.33A4.502 4.502 0 0 0 2.25 15Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Virtuelle arbeidsflater</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Azure Virtual Desktop og Windows 365 for fleksibel, sikker og skalerbar digital arbeidsplass.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-animate="from-right" class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent/10 text-brand-accent">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Automatisering og modernisering</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">PowerShell og strukturert automatisering som gir lavere driftskostnad og høyere kvalitet.</p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
